<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech unit gets Iran cement works order.</title>
<headline>VA Tech unit gets Iran cement works order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian engineering group VA Technologie AG's unit ELIN Energieanwendung on Thursday said it had received an order to equip an Iranian cement works with its electro-technology.</p>
<p>The order is worth 150 million schillings for the Iranian plant near Bojnourd.</p>
<p>The project is expected to be completed in early 1998. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 254</p>
</text>
